      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i think i might be having an allergic reaction to something i ate at lunch. my skin is all itchy and red and my face feels kind of puffy. my throat feels a little tight too but maybe it's just anxiety? should i just take a benadryl and see if it goes away or is this bad?",
