      "content": "the tightness isnt like i cant breathe or anything, just feels weird like my throat is slightly swollen. id rather not go to the er if i dont have to because it's so expensive and i'm pretty sure i'm fine. if i just take a double dose of benadryl right now will that fix the swelling? i just want to sleep this off.",
